&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="background-color:#cceeff;padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"/&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#212121;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"&gt;Fair Value Methods&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify;text-indent:27pt"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify;text-indent:18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;The following methods and assumptions are used to estimate the fair value of financial instruments:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify;text-indent:18pt"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify;text-indent:18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;text-decoration:underline"&gt;ARO Trust investments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt; We are entitled to collect rates in the amounts necessary to fund our future asset retirement obligations (AROs) and deposits a portion of the collected rates into an external trust account (ARO Trust). The ARO Trust invests in a moderate risk portfolio of actively traded mutual funds that are measured at fair value on a recurring basis based on quoted prices in an active market and is reported in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Other Special Funds&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt; on the Balance Sheet. The Money Market Funds held in our ARO Trust are considered an investment. Both realized and unrealized gains and losses are ultimately recorded to the ARO regulatory asset. The current annual funding obligation is approximately $51 million.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#1d1d1d;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt;Investments within the ARO &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#313131;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt;Trust &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#1d1d1d;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt;were &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#313131;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt;as follows&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#1d1d1d;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:18pt"&gt;&lt;table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:95.982%"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:47.427%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:11.303%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.420%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:11.303%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.420%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:11.303%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.420%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.